=== @response:relationships.friends ===
@if rapport >= 60
    PATIENT (sad)
    "Friends? I've kind of [pushed everyone away] lately."
    
    @pause 1
    
    PATIENT
    "It started small. Skipping one hangout because I was tired."
    
    PATIENT
    "Then another because I had to work. And another..."
    
    @pause 0.5
    
    PATIENT (sad)
    "Now they've [stopped asking]."
    
    @if rapport >= 75
        PATIENT (vulnerable)
        "And honestly? It's [easier to be alone] with my worries."
        
        PATIENT
        "At least then I don't have to pretend I'm okay."
        
        @rapport +10
        @reveal social-isolation
    @else
        @rapport +5
    @endif
@else
    PATIENT
    "I have some friends. We hang out sometimes."
    
    PATIENT (deflecting)
