        PATIENT (sad)
        "But I can feel them [pulling away] sometimes."
        
        PATIENT
        "I'm not really... present. Even when I'm there."
        
        PATIENT (vulnerable)
        "My body's in the room but my mind is [somewhere else]."
        
        PATIENT (sad)
        "Worrying about everything except the person right in front of me."
        
        @rapport +10
        @reveal relationship-strain
    @else
        PATIENT (deflecting)
        "Things are fine. We're fine."
        
        @rapport +3
    @endif
