@endif

=== @response:relationships.trust ===
@if rapport >= 70
    PATIENT (thoughtful)
    "Trust is... hard for me."
    
    @pause 1
    
    PATIENT (vulnerable)
    "I'm always [waiting for people to let me down]."
    
    PATIENT
    "So I keep them at a distance. If they can't get close, they can't hurt me."
    
    @pause 0.5
    
    PATIENT (sad)
    "But it's lonely. Living behind walls like this."
    
    @rapport +8
    @reveal trust-issues
@else
    PATIENT
    "I trust people. The ones who deserve it."
    
    PATIENT (guarded)
    "Why do you ask?"
@endif

