=== @response:physical.symptoms ===
NARRATOR
*Alex shifts uncomfortably in the chair, rolling their shoulders.*

@pause 0.5

@if rapport >= 55
    PATIENT (thoughtful)
    "Physical symptoms? I guess I've noticed a few things..."
    
    PATIENT
    "My shoulders are [always tense]. Like I'm bracing for something."
    
    @pause 0.5
    
    @if rapport >= 70
        PATIENT
        "I get [headaches] almost every day now."
        
        PATIENT (hesitant)
        "And my jaw... my dentist said I've been [clenching it at night]."
        
        PATIENT (embarrassed)
        "I have to wear a mouth guard. It's very sexy."
        
        @rapport +5
        @reveal physical-tension
        @reveal jaw-clenching
    @endif
    
@else
    PATIENT
    "I'm fine physically. Just tired sometimes."
@endif

