    "I eat fine. Normal."
@endif

=== @response:physical.exercise ===
@if rapport >= 50
    PATIENT (deflecting)
    "Exercise? I used to go to the gym regularly."
    
    @pause 0.5
    
    PATIENT (sad)
    "Now I can barely find the energy to [walk to my car]."
    
    PATIENT
    "I keep meaning to start again, but..."
    
