=== @response:self.identity ===
NARRATOR
*Alex is quiet for a long moment, staring into their coffee.*

@pause 2

PATIENT (thoughtful)
"How would I describe myself?"

@pause 1

@if rapport >= 70
    PATIENT (sad)
    "I used to think I was capable. Confident, even."
    
    PATIENT
    "Someone who had their life together."
    
    @pause 1
    
    PATIENT (vulnerable)
    "Now I'm not so sure. I feel like I'm [barely holding it together]."
    
    PATIENT
    "Like there's a version of me that exists for other people..."
    
    PATIENT (sad)
    "And then there's the real me. The one who's [terrified all the time]."
    
    @rapport +10
    @reveal identity-conflict
    
@elseif rapport >= 50
    PATIENT
    "I don't know. Normal? Average?"
    
    PATIENT (deflecting)
    "I've never really thought about it that much."
@else
    PATIENT (guarded)
    "I'm just me. What else is there to say?"
@endif

