    "I do okay at things, I guess."
@endif

=== @response:self.coping ===
@if rapport >= 65
    PATIENT (thoughtful)
    "Coping? I'm not sure I really cope."
    
    PATIENT
    "I survive. I get through each day."
    
    @pause 0.5
    
    @if has_symptom("bitten-nails")
        PATIENT (embarrassed)
        "I [bite my nails]. You probably noticed."
        
        PATIENT
        "It's a nervous habit. Been doing it since I was a kid."
        
        @rapport +3
    @endif
    
    @if rapport >= 75
        PATIENT (vulnerable)
        "Mostly I just try to [stay busy]."
        
        PATIENT
        "If I'm working, I don't have time to worry."
        
        PATIENT (sad)
        "Or at least that's what I tell myself."
        
        @rapport +5
        @reveal avoidance-coping
    @endif
@else
    PATIENT
    "I manage. Everyone has their ways of dealing."
