// CLOSING SEQUENCES
// ===========================================

=== end_turn ===
NARRATOR
*The clock on the wall indicates the session is drawing to a close.*

@pause 1

@if $breakthrough_sleep
    PATIENT (thoughtful)
    "This was... more than I expected."
    
    PATIENT
    "In a good way, I think."
    
    @pause 0.5
    
    PATIENT (hopeful)
    "Can we... talk more next time? About the sleep thing?"
    
@elseif $admitted_anxiety
    PATIENT (hesitant)
    "So... same time next week?"
    
    PATIENT
    "I think I'd like to keep talking."
    
@else
    PATIENT (neutral)
    "Is that it for today?"
    
    PATIENT
    "I'm still not sure what I'm supposed to get out of this."
    
    PATIENT (hesitant)
    "But... I'll come back, I guess."
@endif

-> SESSION_END

=== SESSION_END ===
NARRATOR
*Alex stands, gathering their things. 
At the door, they pause.*

@pause 1

@if rapport >= 60
    PATIENT (small-smile)
    "Thanks for listening. Really."
    
    PATIENT
